ack), and `get_targets` (target = a\n  `StackObject` on the stack, zone `Zone.STACK`).\n- `on_resolve`: capture `amount = getattr(target.source, \"mana_spent\", target.source.mana_cost.cmc)`\n  (Gap F) **before** countering; call `_counter_spell(game, target)`. Then register a **one-shot","numLines":25,"startLine":136,"totalLines":419}}}
