{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EJmVPGBTvfdSQgmod6MDBH","type":"tool_result","content":"152\t### sos_57 — Mana Sculpt  ({1}{U}{U} Instant, \"medium\")\n153\tOracle: *Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to\n154\tcast that spell at the beginning of your next main phase.*\n155\t- Base: `Instant`.\n156\t- **Nearest analogue:** fdn_48 (Refute) for the counter machinery — copy its `_counter_spell`,\n157\t  `can_cast` (a spell other than self must be on the stack), and `get_targets` (target = a\n158\t  `StackObject` on the stack, zone `Zone.STACK`).\n159\t- `on_resolve`: capture `amount = getattr(target.source, \"mana_spent\", target.source.mana_cost.cmc)`\n160\t  (Gap F) **before** countering; call `_counter_spell(game, target)`. Then register a **one-shot\n161\t  delayed trigger** (Gap C event): `TriggerRegistration(event_type=BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent,\n162\t  condition=lambda g,e: e.player is controller, effect=_delayed_add, source=self, controller=...)`.\n163\t  `_delayed_add`: if controller controls a creature with subtype \"Wizard\", `controller.mana_pool.add(\n164\t  ManaType.COLORLESS, amount)`; then `g.trigger_manager.unregister(self)` so it fires once.\n165\t  - Register on `game.trigger_manager` directly in `on_resolve` (the spell goes to graveyard but the\n166\t    delayed trigger persists because it's keyed to `source=self`, and nothing unregisters it until it\n167\t    fires).\n168\t- **Edge cases / tests:** countering removes the spell from stack→its owner's graveyard; mana added\n169\t  only if a Wizard is controlled; amount equals mana spent (test by setting `mana_spent` on a stack\n170\t  object); fires at the controller's next main phase, not the opponent's; one-shot (doesn't re-add).\n171\t  You can unit-test the counter and the delayed-add helper separately without the full main-phase loop.\n172\t\n173\t### sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic  ({10} 7/7 Legendary Avatar, \"complex\")\n174\tOracle: *Costs {1} less per instant/sorcery in your graveyard. Reach. Whenever it attacks, you may\n175\tcast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell\n176\twould be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.*\n177\t- Base: `Creature`, `keywords=Keyword.REACH`, `Supertype.LEGENDARY`, subtypes `{\"Avatar\"}`, 7/7,\n178\t  `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{10}\")`.\n179\t- **Cost reduction:** `cost_reduction(game)` → count cards in controller's graveyard whose\n180\t  `card_types` ∩ {INSTANT, SORCERY} (mirror fdn_6 counting; here count graveyard I/S).\n181\t- **Attack trigger (Gap B):** `register_triggers` → `TriggerRegistration(event_type=\n182\t  AttacksTriggeredEvent, condition=lambda g,e: e.creature is self, effect=_on_attack, source=self,\n183\t  controller=self.controller)`.\n184\t  - `_on_attack`: gather I/S cards in controller's graveyard; if none, return. Ask\n185\t    `controller.choose_yes_no(\"cast a spell from graveyard?\")` (the \"may\"). If yes, pick one\n186\t    (`controller.choose_card(candidates, ...)`), set `chosen._exile_on_resolve = True` (Gap E), then"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d616a92e-14a8-4e9f-8780-afe29cd109e3","uuid":"5e7f7a68-388f-43d8-afca-55fd99c55881","timestamp":"2026-06-04T09:02:47.109Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"### sos_57 — Mana Sculpt  ({1}{U}{U} Instant, \"medium\")\nOracle: *Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to\ncast that spell at the beginning of your next main phase.*\n- Base: `Instant`.\n- **Nearest analogue:** fdn_48 (Refute) for the counter machinery — copy its `_counter_spell`,\n  `can_cast` (a spell other than self must be on the stack), and `get_targets` (target = a\n  `StackObject` on the stack, zone `Zone.STACK`).\n- `on_resolve`: capture `amount = getattr(target.source, \"mana_spent\", target.source.mana_cost.cmc)`\n  (Gap F) **before** countering; call `_counter_spell(game, target)`. Then register a **one-shot\n  delayed trigger** (Gap C event): `TriggerRegistration(event_type=BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent,\n  condition=lambda g,e: e.player is controller, effect=_delayed_add, source=self, controller=...)`.\n  `_delayed_add`: if controller controls a creature with subtype \"Wizard\", `controller.mana_pool.add(\n  ManaType.COLORLESS, amount)`; then `g.trigger_manager.unregister(self)` so it fires once.\n  - Register on `game.trigger_manager` directly in `on_resolve` (the spell goes to graveyard but the\n    delayed trigger persists because it's keyed to `source=self`, and nothing unregisters it until it\n    fires).\n- **Edge cases / tests:** countering removes the spell from stack→its owner's graveyard; mana added\n  only if a Wizard is controlled; amount equals mana spent (test by setting `mana_spent` on a stack\n  object); fires at the controller's next main phase, not the opponent's; one-shot (doesn't re-add).\n  You can unit-test the counter and the delayed-add helper separately without the full main-phase loop.\n\n### sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic  ({10} 7/7 Legendary Avatar, \"complex\")\nOracle: *Costs {1} less per instant/sorcery in your graveyard. Reach. Whenever it attacks, you may\ncast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell\nwould be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.*\n- Base: `Creature`, `keywords=Keyword.REACH`, `Supertype.LEGENDARY`, subtypes `{\"Avatar\"}`, 7/7,\n  `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{10}\")`.\n- **Cost reduction:** `cost_reduction(game)` → count cards in controller's graveyard whose\n  `card_types` ∩ {INSTANT, SORCERY} (mirror fdn_6 counting; here count graveyard I/S).\n- **Attack trigger (Gap B):** `register_triggers` → `TriggerRegistration(event_type=\n  AttacksTriggeredEvent, condition=lambda g,e: e.creature is self, effect=_on_attack, source=self,\n  controller=self.controller)`.\n  - `_on_attack`: gather I/S cards in controller's graveyard; if none, return. Ask\n    `controller.choose_yes_no(\"cast a spell from graveyard?\")` (the \"may\"). If yes, pick one\n    (`controller.choose_card(candidates, ...)`), set `chosen._exile_on_resolve = True` (Gap E), then","numLines":35,"startLine":152,"totalLines":419}}}
