{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sk85rPNFd3eKFM8We6mufr","type":"tool_result","content":"173\t### sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic  ({10} 7/7 Legendary Avatar, \"complex\")\n174\tOracle: *Costs {1} less per instant/sorcery in your graveyard. Reach. Whenever it attacks, you may\n175\tcast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell\n176\twould be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.*\n177\t- Base: `Creature`, `keywords=Keyword.REACH`, `Supertype.LEGENDARY`, subtypes `{\"Avatar\"}`, 7/7,\n178\t  `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{10}\")`.\n179\t- **Cost reduction:** `cost_reduction(game)` → count cards in controller's graveyard whose\n180\t  `card_types` ∩ {INSTANT, SORCERY} (mirror fdn_6 counting; here count graveyard I/S).\n181\t- **Attack trigger (Gap B):** `register_triggers` → `TriggerRegistration(event_type=\n182\t  AttacksTriggeredEvent, condition=lambda g,e: e.creature is self, effect=_on_attack, source=self,\n183\t  controller=self.controller)`.\n184\t  - `_on_attack`: gather I/S cards in controller's graveyard; if none, return. Ask\n185\t    `controller.choose_yes_no(\"cast a spell from graveyard?\")` (the \"may\"). If yes, pick one\n186\t    (`controller.choose_card(candidates, ...)`), set `chosen._exile_on_resolve = True` (Gap E), then\n187\t    `cast_spell_free(game, controller, chosen, Zone.GRAVEYARD)`.\n188\t- **Nearest analogues:** fdn_187 (move card from graveyard) for zone handling; fdn_6 for cost\n189\t  reduction; fdn_11 for `register_triggers`.\n190\t- **Edge cases / tests:** cost reduction clamps (10 generic, so up to 10); empty graveyard → trigger\n191\t  no-ops; the free-cast spell, after resolving, ends up in **exile** not graveyard (Gap E); Reach\n192\t  keyword set. Test `cost_reduction` and `_on_attack` directly with a scripted player; test Gap E by\n193\t  resolving a cheap instant from graveyard with `_exile_on_resolve=True` and asserting it's in exile.\n194\t\n195\t### sos_226 — Silverquill, the Disputant  ({2}{W}{B} 4/4 Elder Dragon, \"medium\")\n196\tOracle: *Flying, vigilance. Each instant and sorcery spell you cast has casualty 1 (as you cast it,\n197\tyou may sacrifice a creature with power ≥1; when you do, copy the spell, may choose new targets).*\n198\t- Base: `Creature`, `keywords=Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.VIGILANCE`, `{\"Elder\",\"Dragon\"}`, LEGENDARY, 4/4.\n199\t- **Casualty via Gap A:** `register_triggers` → register for `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` with\n200\t  `condition`: `e.controller is self.controller` AND the cast spell `e.spell` is an instant or sorcery\n201\t  AND `e.spell is not self`. Effect `_casualty`:\n202\t  - The cast spell's `StackObject` is the current top of stack when the casualty trigger resolves"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d616a92e-14a8-4e9f-8780-afe29cd109e3","uuid":"dec39bb1-2710-48cf-ba35-5efd53d312e3","timestamp":"2026-06-04T09:06:02.616Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"### sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic  ({10} 7/7 Legendary Avatar, \"complex\")\nOracle: *Costs {1} less per instant/sorcery in your graveyard. Reach. Whenever it attacks, you may\ncast target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell\nwould be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.*\n- Base: `Creature`, `keywords=Keyword.REACH`, `Supertype.LEGENDARY`, subtypes `{\"Avatar\"}`, 7/7,\n  `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{10}\")`.\n- **Cost reduction:** `cost_reduction(game)` → count cards in controller's graveyard whose\n  `card_types` ∩ {INSTANT, SORCERY} (mirror fdn_6 counting; here count graveyard I/S).\n- **Attack trigger (Gap B):** `register_triggers` → `TriggerRegistration(event_type=\n  AttacksTriggeredEvent, condition=lambda g,e: e.creature is self, effect=_on_attack, source=self,\n  controller=self.controller)`.\n  - `_on_attack`: gather I/S cards in controller's graveyard; if none, return. Ask\n    `controller.choose_yes_no(\"cast a spell from graveyard?\")` (the \"may\"). If yes, pick one\n    (`controller.choose_card(candidates, ...)`), set `chosen._exile_on_resolve = True` (Gap E), then\n    `cast_spell_free(game, controller, chosen, Zone.GRAVEYARD)`.\n- **Nearest analogues:** fdn_187 (move card from graveyard) for zone handling; fdn_6 for cost\n  reduction; fdn_11 for `register_triggers`.\n- **Edge cases / tests:** cost reduction clamps (10 generic, so up to 10); empty graveyard → trigger\n  no-ops; the free-cast spell, after resolving, ends up in **exile** not graveyard (Gap E); Reach\n  keyword set. Test `cost_reduction` and `_on_attack` directly with a scripted player; test Gap E by\n  resolving a cheap instant from graveyard with `_exile_on_resolve=True` and asserting it's in exile.\n\n### sos_226 — Silverquill, the Disputant  ({2}{W}{B} 4/4 Elder Dragon, \"medium\")\nOracle: *Flying, vigilance. Each instant and sorcery spell you cast has casualty 1 (as you cast it,\nyou may sacrifice a creature with power ≥1; when you do, copy the spell, may choose new targets).*\n- Base: `Creature`, `keywords=Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.VIGILANCE`, `{\"Elder\",\"Dragon\"}`, LEGENDARY, 4/4.\n- **Casualty via Gap A:** `register_triggers` → register for `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` with\n  `condition`: `e.controller is self.controller` AND the cast spell `e.spell` is an instant or sorcery\n  AND `e.spell is not self`. Effect `_casualty`:\n  - The cast spell's `StackObject` is the current top of stack when the casualty trigger resolves","numLines":30,"startLine":173,"totalLines":419}}}
