{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F6Gf74t8oPqqixB7A4gc1Y","type":"tool_result","content":"248\t### sos_201 — Lorehold, the Historian  ({3}{R}{W} 5/5 Elder Dragon, \"expert\")\n249\tOracle: *Flying, haste. Each instant/sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}. At the beginning of\n250\teach opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card; if you do, draw a card.*\n251\t- Base: `Creature`, `keywords=Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.HASTE`, `{\"Elder\",\"Dragon\"}`, LEGENDARY, 5/5.\n252\t- **Opponent-upkeep loot:** `register_triggers` → `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` (fired with no\n253\t  player; check `game.active_player is not self.controller`). Effect: if controller has ≥1 card in\n254\t  hand, `choose_yes_no`; if yes, pick a card → `discard(game, controller, card)` then\n255\t  `draw_card(game, controller)`.\n256\t- **Miracle {2} (Gap G + draw trigger):** `register_triggers` → `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent`,\n257\t  `condition`: `e.player is self.controller` AND drawn `e.card` is instant/sorcery AND it's the first\n258\t  card drawn this turn (`getattr(e.player,'cards_drawn_this_turn',0) == 1` — Gap G makes this reset per\n259\t  turn; `draw_card` increments before firing). Effect `_miracle`: ask `choose_yes_no(\"cast <card> for\n260\t  miracle {2}?\")`; if yes and `controller.mana_pool.can_pay(ManaCost.parse(\"{2}\"))`, pay it and\n261\t  `cast_spell_free(game, controller, e.card_FROM_CONDITION, Zone.HAND)`. Because the effect gets no\n262\t  event, stash the drawn card on `self._miracle_card` in the condition and read it in the effect; clear\n263\t  it after. (Paying {2} then free-casting approximates \"cast for {2}\".)\n264\t  - **Simplification to document:** real miracle is a special action on draw; we model it as a draw\n265\t    trigger that offers a {2} cast. Acceptable for this engine.\n266\t- **Edge cases / tests:** loot only on opponents' upkeeps, not your own; loot is optional and needs a\n267\t  card in hand; miracle only on the first draw of the turn and only for I/S; declining miracle leaves\n268\t  the card in hand. Test the loot trigger and the miracle condition/effect directly.\n269\t\n270\t### sos_226 done above; ### sos_13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares  ({1}{W}{W} 3/3 Cat Cleric, \"complex\")\n271\tOracle (creature side): *When this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling\n272\ttoken with flying. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared.\n273\t(While prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell — Swords to Plowshares — which unprepares it.)*\n274\tSpell side (Swords to Plowshares, {W} Instant): *Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal\n275\tto its power.*\n276\t- Base: `Creature`, `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{W}{W}\")` (parse only the creature side — the spec's\n277\t  `mana_cost` is `\"{1}{W}{W} // {W}\"`, which `ManaCost.parse` cannot handle; hard-code the creature"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d616a92e-14a8-4e9f-8780-afe29cd109e3","uuid":"04229f08-e184-4dbc-8a51-44b659b6e89d","timestamp":"2026-06-04T09:14:04.467Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"### sos_201 — Lorehold, the Historian  ({3}{R}{W} 5/5 Elder Dragon, \"expert\")\nOracle: *Flying, haste. Each instant/sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}. At the beginning of\neach opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card; if you do, draw a card.*\n- Base: `Creature`, `keywords=Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.HASTE`, `{\"Elder\",\"Dragon\"}`, LEGENDARY, 5/5.\n- **Opponent-upkeep loot:** `register_triggers` → `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` (fired with no\n  player; check `game.active_player is not self.controller`). Effect: if controller has ≥1 card in\n  hand, `choose_yes_no`; if yes, pick a card → `discard(game, controller, card)` then\n  `draw_card(game, controller)`.\n- **Miracle {2} (Gap G + draw trigger):** `register_triggers` → `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent`,\n  `condition`: `e.player is self.controller` AND drawn `e.card` is instant/sorcery AND it's the first\n  card drawn this turn (`getattr(e.player,'cards_drawn_this_turn',0) == 1` — Gap G makes this reset per\n  turn; `draw_card` increments before firing). Effect `_miracle`: ask `choose_yes_no(\"cast <card> for\n  miracle {2}?\")`; if yes and `controller.mana_pool.can_pay(ManaCost.parse(\"{2}\"))`, pay it and\n  `cast_spell_free(game, controller, e.card_FROM_CONDITION, Zone.HAND)`. Because the effect gets no\n  event, stash the drawn card on `self._miracle_card` in the condition and read it in the effect; clear\n  it after. (Paying {2} then free-casting approximates \"cast for {2}\".)\n  - **Simplification to document:** real miracle is a special action on draw; we model it as a draw\n    trigger that offers a {2} cast. Acceptable for this engine.\n- **Edge cases / tests:** loot only on opponents' upkeeps, not your own; loot is optional and needs a\n  card in hand; miracle only on the first draw of the turn and only for I/S; declining miracle leaves\n  the card in hand. Test the loot trigger and the miracle condition/effect directly.\n\n### sos_226 done above; ### sos_13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares  ({1}{W}{W} 3/3 Cat Cleric, \"complex\")\nOracle (creature side): *When this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling\ntoken with flying. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared.\n(While prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell — Swords to Plowshares — which unprepares it.)*\nSpell side (Swords to Plowshares, {W} Instant): *Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal\nto its power.*\n- Base: `Creature`, `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{W}{W}\")` (parse only the creature side — the spec's\n  `mana_cost` is `\"{1}{W}{W} // {W}\"`, which `ManaCost.parse` cannot handle; hard-code the creature","numLines":30,"startLine":248,"totalLines":419}}}
