). discard(game, player, card). sacrifice(game, player, permanent). create_token(game, player, token) (game.py:353). exile(game, obj). cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone). copy_spell(game, original_StackObject, controller, new_targets=None)->StackObject.\n   - ZoneContainer: index 0 = bottom, -1 = top; `top(n)` returns last n; `add(obj, position=\"top\")` appends. No set_library helper; add to `player.zones[Zone.LIBRARY]` directly (top = last added).\n   - StackObject(source, controller, targets=[], on_resolve, is_mana_ability). Stack: push/pop(LIFO)/peek/objects()(reversed)/is_empty/`_items`; NO `size()` method (use `len(game.stack._items)`).\n   - ManaType.COLORLESS=\"C\" (no GENERIC). ManaPool: add(type, amount), get(type), total(), can_pay(cost), pay(cost), empty(). ManaCost.parse(\"{X}{C}...\"), `.cmc`, `.generic`. ManaCost.parse CANNOT handle \"//\" split-card costs.\n   - Keyword (Flag): FLYING, DEATHTOUCH, REACH, VIGILANCE, HASTE, LIFELINK, etc. Supertype.LEGENDARY. Creature kwargs: base_power, base_toughness, subtypes (set of str), supertypes (set of Supertype).\n   - DeterministicPlayer: choose/choose_target/choose_yes_no/choose_card/assign_damage_order pop from `_script` deque; `remaining_choices`; ScriptExhaustedError when empty. test_utils.cast_spell appendlefts targets reversed; declare_attackers appendlefts the attackers list itself (don't double-add); set_board_state(battlefield=/hand=/graveyard=/life=/mana=).\n   - create_game default active_player_index=0 (p1).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py` & tests.py — DONE (Together as One, Sorcery {6}, converge). 5 tests pass.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py` — DONE. WitherbloomTheBalancer(Creature), {6}{B}{G}, 5/5, {\"Elder\",\"Dragon\"}, LEGENDARY, FLYING|DEATHTOUCH. Helper `_count_creatures(game, player)`. `cost_reduction` returns creature count; `grant_cost_reduction(self, game, spell)` returns count if spell.controller is self.controller and spell is I/S else 0. tests.py 8 pass.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py` — DONE. ManaSculpt(Instant) {1}{U}{U}. Copies fdn_48 `_get_chosen_target`, `_counter_spell`, `can_cast`, `get_targets` (target spell on stack, Zone.STACK). `_controls_wizard`. on_resolve: get target, `amount = getattr(target.source, \"mana_spent\", None)` fallback to cmc, `_counter_spell`, if controller controls Wizard register delayed BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent trigger `condition=lambda g,e: e.player is controller`, effect adds COLORLESS amount and unregisters self (one-shot). tests.py 9 pass.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py` — DONE. TheDawningArchaic(Creature) {10} 7/7 {\"Avatar\"} LEGENDARY REACH. Helper `_graveyard_instants_sorceries`. `cost_reduction` counts graveyard I/S. register_triggers: AttacksTriggeredEvent `condition=lambda g,e: e.creature is source`, effect `_on_attack` — if candidates, choose_yes_no, choose_card, set `chosen._exile_on_resolve=True`, `cast_spell_free(g, ctrl, chosen, Zone.GRAVEYARD)`. tests.py 6 pass.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py` — DONE. SilverquillTheDisputant(Creature) {2}{W}{B} 4/4 Elder Dragon LEGENDARY FLYING|VIGILANCE. Helper `_power(obj)`. register_triggers: SpellCastTriggeredEvent condition (controller match, spell I/S, not self), effect `_casualty` — `spell_obj = g.stack.peek()`, find fodder creatures (CREATURE, power≥1), choose_yes_no, choose_card, `sacrifice`, `copy_spell`, `g.stack.push(copy)`. tests.py 6 pass (note: dragon itself is valid power-4 fodder).\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_120/card_impl.py` — DONE. ImprovisationCapstone(Sorcery) {5}{R}{R} {\"Lesson\"}. on_resolve: set `_exile_on_resolve=True`, `_improvise` (exile from library top accumulating cmc until ≥4, then per non-land exiled card choose_yes_no + cast_spell_free from EXILE wrapped in try/except CastingError), then `_arm_paradigm` if not `_is_paradigm_copy`. `_arm_paradigm` (guarded by `_paradigm_armed`) registers BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent `condition=... e.player is controller and e.is_first_main`, effect copies self, flags copy `_is_paradigm_copy`/`_paradigm_armed`, adds to EXILE, cast_spell_free. Module docstring documents the simplification. tests.py 8 pass.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py` — DONE. LoreholdTheHistorian(Creature) {3}{R}{W} 5/5 Elder Dragon LEGENDARY FLYING|HASTE. register_triggers: (a) BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent `condition=g.active_player is not ctrl`, effect `_loot` (choose_yes_no, choose_card, discard, draw_card); (b) DrawsCardTriggeredEvent `_miracle_condition` (player is ctrl, card is I/S, `cards_drawn_this_turn == 1`, stashes `_miracle_card`), effect `_miracle` (choose_yes_no, if can_pay {2} pay it, cast_spell_free from HAND). Module docstring documents miracle simplification. tests.py 9 pass.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py` — NOT YET WRITTEN (current task). Template is the stub `class EmeritusOfTruce...//class name TBD` — actually the template class is currently the default stub; need to Read it before Write (harness requirement). PLAN guidance: Creature, `mana_cost=ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{W}{W}\")` (hard-code creature side — spec mana_cost is \"{1}{W}{W} // {W}\" which ManaCost.parse can't handle), subtypes {\"Cat\",\"Cleric\"}, colors W, 3/3, `keywords=Keyword(0)`, track `self.prepared: bool = False` (Prepared is custom, not a Keyword flag). ETB trigger via register_triggers EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent `condition: e.permanent is self`: (1) target player (chosen_targets[0] else default controller) creates 1/1 Inkling flying token via create_token; (2) if any opponent controls more creatures than controller, set `self.prepared=True`. Also get_targets returning one player-target TargetRequirement (filter `hasattr(obj,'life')`); default target to controller when none chosen. Expose `get_activated_abilities()` returning one ActivatedAbility available only while `self.prepared` (cost {W}): Swords to Plowshare