{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HtkPJRBYoyUrT3fz8CNQgn","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/continuous_effects.py:154:    def remove_expired(self, game: GameState) -> int:\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-155-        \"\"\"Remove effects whose duration has expired.\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-156-\nengine/continuous_effects.py-157-        - ``DURATION_PERMANENT`` (−1): never expires automatically.\nengine/continuous_effects.py-158-        - ``DURATION_END_OF_TURN`` (0): removed when this method is called\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-159-          (typically during the cleanup step).\nengine/continuous_effects.py-160-        - Positive integer *n*: removed when ``game.turn_number > n``.\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-161-\nengine/continuous_effects.py-162-        Args:\nengine/continuous_effects.py-163-            game: The current game state (used for turn number).\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-164-\nengine/continuous_effects.py-165-        Returns:\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-166-            The number of effects removed.\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-167-        \"\"\"\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-168-        before = len(self._effects)\n--\nengine/continuous_effects.py:184:    def apply_all(self, game: GameState) -> None:\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-185-        \"\"\"Apply all active effects in layer order, then timestamp order.\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-186-\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-187-        Before applying, all objects on each player's battlefield are reset\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-188-        to their original (pre-effect) characteristics so that calling this\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-189-        method multiple times is idempotent.\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-190-\n/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py-191-        Within each layer (a