{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_0123T6JewMUXcEoZBQULmdhi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 10 SOS cards are now implemented and the full suite is green.\n\n**sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex** (final card) is complete:\n- `card_impl.py`: `GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex(Land)` with two mana abilities (`{T}: Add {C}` and `{T}, Pay 1 life: any color`), the `{5}` animation ability (2/4 Wizard creature that's still a land), and the +1/+0 instant/sorcery pump trigger.\n- `tests.py`: 18 tests covering properties, both mana abilities (tap/life/color), animation (method + activated-ability path, once-only, mana gating, idempotence), the pump (instant/sorcery yes, creature/opponent no, stacking), and cleanup reset (pump wiped, animation durable).\n\n**Verification:**\n- `cards/sos/sos_257/ engine_tests/`: 1162 passed.\n- Full `cards/ engine_tests/` suite: **1276 passed**, no regressions.\n- Real-engine smoke check passed end-to-end: `{C}` mana; any-color with life loss; `{5}` → 2/4 Wizard land-creature (rejecting a second activation); instant cast pumps to 3; cleanup `apply_all` wipes the pump back to 2 while keeping the land + creature animation.\n\nDesign note (already in the card docstring): animation durability is achieved by overriding `_reset_characteristics` to re-assert CREATURE+Wizard and base 2/4 whenever `_animated` is set, and the pump is a transient `modified_power += 1` bump that cleanup's `apply_all` wipes — rather than registering a separate continuous effect. The any-color \"spend only on instant/sorcery\" restriction is intentionally unenforced since the engine's `ManaPool` doesn't tag mana by allowed use.\n\nAll tasks (#1–#11) are now completed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":88,"cache_read_input_tokens":75951,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":88},"output